MODIFIER
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER               Windows / Meta key


SCREENSHOTS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + X           Select region → save to ~/Pictures/Captures
  ALT + X             Screenshot active window
  ALT + SHIFT + X     Select monitor → save to ~/Pictures/Captures


APPLICATIONS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + Q           Open terminal
  SUPER + E           Open file manager
  SUPER + R           Open Launcher
  SUPER + S           Open Steam
  SUPER + SHIFT + S   Open Steam Big Picture
  SUPER + T           Restart Quickshell


WINDOW MANAGEMENT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + C           Close active window
  SUPER + V           Toggle floating window
  SUPER + P           Toggle pseudo-tiling
  SUPER + J           Toggle split direction
  SUPER + M           Shutdown / exit Hyprland

  SUPER + ←           Focus window left
  SUPER + →           Focus window right
  SUPER + ↑           Focus window above
  SUPER + ↓           Focus window below

  SUPER + LMB         Move / drag window
  SUPER + RMB         Resize window


WORKSPACES
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + 1-9         Switch to workspace 1-9
  SUPER + 0           Switch to workspace 10

  SUPER + SHIFT + 1-9
                      Move window to workspace 1-9

  SUPER + SHIFT + 0   Move window to workspace 10

  SUPER + S           Toggle "magic" scratchpad
  SUPER + SHIFT + S   Move window to "magic" scratchpad

  SUPER + SCROLL UP   Next workspace
  SUPER + SCROLL DOWN Previous workspace
